    <textarea name="article" data-editor-value hidden aria-label="Release note">&lt;h2&gt;Faster checkout&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The payment step now keeps the basket while a card is &lt;em&gt;confirmed&lt;/em&gt;, so a slow bank no longer empties it. See the &lt;a href="/help/checkout"&gt;checkout guide&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Saved cards load before the form.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;An expired card says so at once.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;A retry keeps the reader where they were.&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;pre&gt;checkout.retry = "keep-basket"&lt;/pre&gt;</textarea>
